**/Install/**

**/Capture/**
.claude/worktrees/eloquent-hodgkin/
.claude/worktrees/naughty-gould/
AppSrc/Tests/_starzenIndentTest.pkg
AppSrc/Tests/_starzenIndentTest.pkg
AppSrc/Tests/UnusedVars-PartialVariableNames.pkg
